      "created_at": "2025-10-10T23:28:10.140Z",
      "cooked": "<p>The behavior that you’re experiencing seems in keeping with setting below.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/c/7/c733472676430feadacec71e50fc6a25adb2f8ac.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/c733472676430feadacec71e50fc6a25adb2f8ac\" title=\"IMG_2187\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/c/7/c733472676430feadacec71e50fc6a25adb2f8ac_2_230x500.jpeg\" alt=\"IMG_2187\" data-base62-sha1=\"sqcSvb9AYbm8YkbgJQ2BS2h9zre\" width=\"230\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/c/7/c733472676430feadacec71e50fc6a25adb2f8ac_2_230x500.jpeg, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/c/7/c733472676430feadacec71e50fc6a25adb2f8ac_2_345x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/c/7/c733472676430feadacec71e50fc6a25adb2f8ac_2_460x1000.jpeg 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"D8D9DB\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">IMG_2187</span><span class=\"informations\">1290×2796 321 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>Is this setting implying you’ll need to issue a “bill” aka a credit invoice which will run through COGs, no?</p>",
